n around a listed service. Its schedule includes student-focused Sunday evening Masses in the academic year.","short_summary":"A historic on-campus church that serves SLU and the parish community.","evidence_claim":"SLU identifies St. Francis Xavier College Church as a worship space for the University and parish community and says Campus Ministry runs 4:30 p.m. and 8 p.m. Sunday Masses during the academic year.","source_url":"https://www.slu.edu/life-at-slu/campus-ministry/prayer-and-worship/index.php","source_title":"Pray: Prayer and Worship","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Service times vary by academic calendar; consult the current Mass schedule before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-chaifetz-arena","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Chaifetz Arena","title":"Find the arena before game day","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon · Campus athletics landmark","notes":"Walk by Chaifetz Arena and note its location near the Billiken statue. Later, use the official athletics schedule to decide whether a game fits your calendar.","short_summary":"SLU’s home venue for basketball and volleyball.","evidence_claim":"SLU identifies Chaifetz Arena as the 10,600-seat home of its men’s and women’s basketball teams and volleyball team.","source_url":"https://www.slu.edu/business-finance/departments-and-offices/auxiliary-services.php","source_title":"Saint Louis University Auxiliary Services","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Exterior viewing is separate from event entry; check the official athletics schedule and event ticket terms for access.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-fair","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"SLU Fair","title":"Put the 